---
# ansible-lint's settings. The binary comes from the Nix dev shell and the
# `ansible-lint` pre-commit hook runs it over the whole project.
#
# Lint without the network: no version check and no rule lookups, so a hook run
# (and CI) is reproducible and works offline. YAML style is yamllint's job
# (.yamllint); ansible-lint keeps its own YAML rules on.
offline: true
